OL,3,AGoogle resolves cloud outage affecting
OL,4,AUK banks and websites
OL,5,
OL,6,FRevolut, Lloyds Bank and HSBC were
OL,7,Famong popular UK services that
OL,8,Fconfirmed disruption on Tuesday
OL,9,Fmorning, after thousands of reports of
OL,10,Fproblems were raised by users online.
OL,12,FThe tech giant apologised to those
OL,13,Faffected and thanked customers for
OL,14,Ftheir patience.
